report","date":"2020-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/540293/64991540293.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2019-06-01","title":"Jun 2019 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=240cdf9e-f6a2-457d-a462-1b10871f75da.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2019-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/540293/5402930319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2018-05-01","title":"May 2018 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8ccdea28-9bb4-4481-8f70-a27a070a7869.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2018-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/540293/5402930318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2018-02-01","title":"Feb 2018 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3f0094fb-aca1-4137-a916-f123282dff21.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_transcript","date":"2017-11-01","title":"Nov 2017 Concall Transcript","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=129e880e-07f6-46ca-997e-8636ee436d3e.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2017-11-01","title":"Nov 2017 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=41770910-f66f-4803-87f0-bde0d2f9c223.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2017-05-01","title":"May 2017 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9a4acc53-5b7f-4a5f-bd65-0ccf7d8b8045.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2017-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/540293/5402930317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2016-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2016/PRICOL_LTD-540293-MARCH-2016.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2015-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2015/PRICOL_LTD-540293-MARCH-2015.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2014-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/PRICOL_LTD-540293-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2013-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/PRICOL_LTD-540293-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2012-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/PRICOL_LTD-540293-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Pricol Ltd reported consolidated revenue of INR 1,077.9 crores for Q4 FY26 and close to INR 4,000 crores for the full year FY26, alongside robust profit and EBITDA growth. Management highlighted multiple macroeconomic and geopolitical headwinds including the West Asia crisis, rising polymer, aluminum, semiconductor, and freight costs, and currency depreciation. Consequently, the company anticipates a softening of earnings and a slowdown in the automotive sector, yet maintains its long-term investment focus, R&D commitments, and active cost-recovery discussions with OEM customers. Pricol Limited released its Q4 and FY26 earnings presentation, detailing consolidated financial figures including revenue from operations and profit after tax. The company highlighted its manufacturing presence, product verticals, major customers, and select new product launches for the quarter.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management expects exports to reach 10% of revenue in the coming years.","quote":"And our goal is to take it to 10% of revenue in the coming years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted that geopolitical headwinds will likely cause a softening of earnings and a slowing of the automotive sector.","quote":"So, while we are not scaling back on any of our critical activities that is going to hamper the growth of the company, we do believe that there will be softening of earnings and slowing of the whole automotive sector on account of these geopolitical headwinds that are actually sending ripples across the world.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management observed that April was reasonably okay due to pipeline inventory and raw materials bought at earlier rates.","quote":"April was reasonably okay because we had a lot of pipeline inventory, pipeline stocks and raw material that were bought at earlier rates.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that loss of market share is not a concern for the next three years due to confirmed LOIs for most programs.","quote":"So, for the next three years, barring degrowth or slowing down of the market, loss of market share is not something that we need to fear about.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company planned a capital expenditure of INR 680 crores to INR 700 crores for the year.","quote":"In fact, this year, in itself, we have planned for about between INR 680 crore to INR 700 crores of CAPEX to cater to all of our new businesses that we have won, new plants, new machines, so on and so forth, which will keep propelling us forward and to maintain this growth momentum.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that production with BOE will commence in about 10 to 12 months.","quote":"Work is under progress on the equipment and the machinery and the buildings, and we will be commencing in about 10 to 12 months' production.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management indicated that commercial readiness with Domino is expected in 18 to 24 months.","quote":"With Domino, more like 18 months to 24 months is where we will be ready, and the early stages of revenue will start trickling in, right?","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management stated that polymer, aluminum, semiconductor, memory control device, and freight costs have all increased significantly.","quote":"Polymer prices have gone up by about 55%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that freight and foreign exchange expenses contributed to the quarter-on-quarter increase in standalone other expenses.","quote":"One is FOREX, which has gone up to INR 95. And the other one is the freight, because the freight cost is in line with the revenue increase.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Management stated that capacity utilization in the plastics division has reached a peak.","quote":"In fact, so much so that in plastics, we are unable to grow this year because of lack of capacity, which is why you see the ROCE at a very high figure compared to what I had given guidance for because of sweating the capital assets.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management confirmed that the company has maintained market share by volume and increased it by value for instrument clusters.","quote":"We have maintained our market share by volume and increased our market share by value.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Net debt stood at INR 63.11 crores as of 31st March 2026 after accounting for reclassified supplier and customer bill discounting.","quote":"Just to give you a perspective, barring the supplier discounting and the customer bill discounting which earlier was hitherto treated as trade payable, now actual borrowing as of 31st March 2026, net debt is INR 63.11 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"The Board recommended retaining the dividend at 200% for FY26 to conserve cash in light of upcoming capital investments and headwinds.","quote":"So, this is something that we took a conscious call yesterday. We had the subject of the dividend, and the entire Board, including myself, recommended that we retain it at a 200% dividend for the FY26, see the performance for the next six months, and then take a call on that subject.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Considering the ongoing economic crisis and to conserve cash for future expansions, no final dividend is recommended by the Board for FY 2025-26.","quote":"Considering the ongoing economic crisis and to conserve the cash for future expansions, no final dividend is recommended by the Board for the FY 2025-26.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6cc3d8a5-a525-41fa-a7ee-f34e6b7b5011.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management highlighted multiple external headwinds including the semiconductor crisis, rare earth magnet crisis, and the West Asia crisis.","quote":"This financial year started off with a semiconductor crisis, followed by a rare earth magnet crisis, followed by the West Asia crisis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"},{"claim":"Management observed that the Indian Rupee is on a free fall.","quote":"The rupee is on a free fall.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management expects production with BOE to commence in about 10 to 12 months.","quote":"Work is under progress on the equipment and the machinery and the buildings, and we will be commencing in about 10 to 12 months' production.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf","timeframe":"10 to 12 months"},{"claim":"Management stated that readiness for revenue from Domino will take 18 to 24 months.","quote":"With Domino, more like 18 months to 24 months is where we will be ready, and the early stages of revenue will start trickling in, right?","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ceafd440-d32e-4124-b0d8-0986c8098710.pdf","timeframe":"18 to 24 months"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt","annual_report"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":18,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":16,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}